  "title": "月亮工厂MCF 【Moon Create factory】",
  "description": "以机械动力和社交为核心的整合包，通过机械设备和你朋友一起创造快乐的世界。体验更加浓厚的科技机械之美。\n\nAn integrated package centered on mechanical power and social interaction, creating a happy world with your friends through mechanical devices. Experience a stronger beauty of technology and machinery.",
  "body": "MCF是英文 moon Create factory 的缩写\n\n这是一款使用Fabirc、机械动力和社交为核心的整合包，通过机械设备和社交互动来创造属于你和你朋友的快乐世界。与好友体验更加浓厚的科技机械之美。\n\n<a href=\"https://afdian.com/a/moonmc\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://pic1.afdiancdn.com/static/img/welcome/button-sponsorme.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LyzFLpMy7QA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n\n<details><summary><h1>English</h1></summary>\n\nMCF is the abbreviation for Moon Create factory in English\nThis is an integrated package that uses Fabirc, mechanical power, and social interaction as its core, creating a happy world for you and your friends through mechanical devices and social interaction. Experience a stronger beauty of technology and machinery with friends.\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details><summary><h1>外部MOD</h1></summary>\n\n\nExcellent mod application\n\neffortless\n\nhttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effortless-building\n\nMineMenuFabric\n\nhttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minemenu-refabricated/\n\ntalkbubbles\n\nhttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/talkbubbles\n\nworldedit\n\nhttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldedit\n\nXaerosWorldMap\n\nhttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\n\n\n</details>\n",
